# Apple Intelligence / new Siri compatibility rules for Surge.
# Reviewed 2026-11-11. Surge RULE-SET format; 24 rules.
# Reference from [Rule]: RULE-SET,appleAI-siri-surge-20261111.list,Ai
# Replace Ai with an existing policy/group in your Surge profile.
# This list controls routing, not account/device/OS/language eligibility.
#
# Official service inventory:
# https://support.apple.com/en-us/101555
# Current Siri eligibility:
# https://support.apple.com/en-us/127893
# Community compatibility reference (not an Apple guarantee):
# https://github.com/RocM301/Apple-Rule/blob/main/Apple%20AI-New
#
# Broad ls.apple.com and apps.mzstatic.com rules are intentionally omitted.
# They return to the remaining routing rules (normally the Apple group).
# Officially documented Siri, search, PCC and Intelligence extensions.
DOMAIN,guzzoni.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,smoot.apple.com
DOMAIN,apple-relay.apple.com
DOMAIN,apple-relay.cloudflare.com
DOMAIN,apple-relay.fastly-edge.com
DOMAIN,cp4.cloudflare.com

# New Siri / relay aliases from the community compatibility list.
# Exact hosts avoid routing unrelated Apple infrastructure through Ai.
DOMAIN,api-siri-prod.apple.com
DOMAIN,seed.siri.apple.com
DOMAIN,apple-relay.mask.apple-dns.net
DOMAIN,apple-relay.akamaized.net
DOMAIN,apple-carry-relay.cloudflare.com
DOMAIN,mask-api.fe2.apple-dns.net

# Gateway compatibility: preserve existing child-host matching.
# The fe2 alias was also observed in this router's connection logs.
# These shared services are not exclusive to Siri.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gateway.icloud.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gateway.fe2.apple-dns.net

# Narrow startup/service compatibility entries from the community list.
# Not officially established as mandatory for Siri activation.
DOMAIN,gspe1-ssl.ls.apple.com
DOMAIN,wps.apple.com
DOMAIN,probe.icloud.com
DOMAIN,metrics.icloud.com

# Preserve the existing Private Relay compatibility routing.
# These are shared iCloud services, not evidence of Siri-only dependencies.
DOMAIN,mask-api.fe.apple-dns.net
DOMAIN,mask-api.icloud.com
DOMAIN,mask-h2.icloud.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,mask-t.apple-dns.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,mask.apple-dns.net
DOMAIN,mask.icloud.com
